  heroes  random.choose, random.choose_chacha8
  go      -
  rust    -
  python  random.choice
  note    an empty list fails `invalid`, where Python raises

capability random/secure-choose  an element drawn from a list by the system's generator for keys
  heroes  random.secure_choose
  go      -
  rust    -
  python  secrets.choice
  note    Lemire's method over eight bytes at a time of `os.random_bytes`, as `secure_below` draws, so no element is favoured; an empty list fails `invalid`, where Python raises

capability random/sample  elements drawn without replacement
  heroes  random.sample
  go      -
